{"id":"c26859179739aef8","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-prop-kolmogorov-feller.md","title":"Kolmogorov's Equations","display":"prop-kolmogorov-feller — Kolmogorov's Equations","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-kolmogorov-feller","aliases":["58-prop-kolmogorov-feller"],"display":"prop-kolmogorov-feller — Kolmogorov's Equations","depends_on":["[[58-df-feller-process]]","[[58-df-transition-density]]","[[../batch08/58-df-infinitesimal-generator.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-kolmogorov-feller"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-kolmogorov-feller</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-kolmogorov-feller — Kolmogorov's Equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1212025633f2b50c\" href=\"?note=1212025633f2b50c\" title=\"58-df-feller-process\">58-df-feller-process</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef103f0303462b75\" href=\"?note=ef103f0303462b75\" title=\"58-df-transition-density\">58-df-transition-density</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"327e84380a3593f4\" href=\"?note=327e84380a3593f4\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-infinitesimal-generator.md\">../batch08/58-df-infinitesimal-generator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P,K,p,m,L,D_L,L^*,D_{L^*}\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P,K,p,m,L,D_L,L^*,D_{L^*}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span> is the imported process predicate, whose last two arguments are the state topology and transition semigroup</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TransitionDensity}_S(p,K,m;E,\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{TransitionDensity}_S(p,K,m;E,\\mathcal E)\\)</span> is the imported density predicate for the transition kernel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfinitesimalGenerator}_S(L,D_L,P,E,\\tau_E)\">\\(\\mathrm{InfinitesimalGenerator}_S(L,D_L,P,E,\\tau_E)\\)</span> is the imported five-place generator predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(h,E,\\mathcal E,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(h,E,\\mathcal E,m)\\)</span> is the imported representative-level integrability predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FormalAdjoint}_{m,S}(L^*,D_{L^*};L,D_L;E,\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{FormalAdjoint}_{m,S}(L^*,D_{L^*};L,D_L;E,\\mathcal E)\\)</span> is defined below by the integral duality identity; products of functions are pointwise</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_t(\\,\\cdot\\,,y)\">\\(p_t(\\,\\cdot\\,,y)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_t(x,\\,\\cdot\\,)\">\\(p_t(x,\\,\\cdot\\,)\\)</span> denote the two sections of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(t,x,y)\">\\(p(t,x,y)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^1(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^1(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\mathbb R)\\)</span> denotes continuously differentiable real functions on positive time</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formal\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}for\\text{-}kolmogorov}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FormalAdjoint}_{m,S}(L^*,D_{L^*};L,D_L;E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall u\\in D_L\\;\\forall v\\in D_{L^*}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(L(u)\\cdot v,E,\\mathcal E,m)\n\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(u\\cdot L^*(v),E,\\mathcal E,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\land\n\\int_E L(u)(z)v(z)\\,m(dz)=\\int_E u(z)L^*(v)(z)\\,m(dz)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formal\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}for\\text{-}kolmogorov}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FormalAdjoint}_{m,S}(L^*,D_{L^*};L,D_L;E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall u\\in D_L\\;\\forall v\\in D_{L^*}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(L(u)\\cdot v,E,\\mathcal E,m)\n\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(u\\cdot L^*(v),E,\\mathcal E,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\land\n\\int_E L(u)(z)v(z)\\,m(dz)=\\int_E u(z)L^*(v)(z)\\,m(dz)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}feller}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S(X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{TransitionDensity}_S(p,K,m;E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{InfinitesimalGenerator}_S(L,D_L,P,E,\\tau_E)\n\\land\\operatorname{FormalAdjoint}_{m,S}(L^*,D_{L^*};L,D_L;E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\\forall g\\in C_0(E,\\tau_E)\\;\n\\left(P(t)(g)(x)=\\int_E g(y)p(t,x,y)\\,m(dy)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in E\\;\\Bigl(\np_t(\\,\\cdot\\,,y)\\in D_L\n\\land p_t(x,\\,\\cdot\\,)\\in D_{L^*}\n\\land p(\\,\\cdot\\,,x,y)\\in C^1(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\mathbb R)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in E\\;\\left[\n\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}p(t,x,y)\n=\\bigl(L[p_t(\\,\\cdot\\,,y)]\\bigr)(x)\n\\land\n\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}p(t,x,y)\n=\\bigl(L^*[p_t(x,\\,\\cdot\\,)]\\bigr)(y)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}feller}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S(X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{TransitionDensity}_S(p,K,m;E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{InfinitesimalGenerator}_S(L,D_L,P,E,\\tau_E)\n\\land\\operatorname{FormalAdjoint}_{m,S}(L^*,D_{L^*};L,D_L;E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\\forall g\\in C_0(E,\\tau_E)\\;\n\\left(P(t)(g)(x)=\\int_E g(y)p(t,x,y)\\,m(dy)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in E\\;\\Bigl(\np_t(\\,\\cdot\\,,y)\\in D_L\n\\land p_t(x,\\,\\cdot\\,)\\in D_{L^*}\n\\land p(\\,\\cdot\\,,x,y)\\in C^1(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\mathbb R)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in E\\;\\left[\n\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}p(t,x,y)\n=\\bigl(L[p_t(\\,\\cdot\\,,y)]\\bigr)(x)\n\\land\n\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}p(t,x,y)\n=\\bigl(L^*[p_t(x,\\,\\cdot\\,)]\\bigr)(y)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The backward generator acts in the starting variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>, whereas the\nforward adjoint acts in the terminal variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>.  A Feller process alone\ndoes not guarantee a density or the differentiability/domain hypotheses,\nso these are explicit antecedents.</li>\n<li>The process predicate now receives its exact topology and semigroup arguments.  A distinct kernel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> supplies the density, and the displayed integral identity ties that density to the same semigroup <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> whose generator is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-feller-process","status":"resolved","id":"1212025633f2b50c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-feller-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transition-density","status":"resolved","id":"ef103f0303462b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transition-density]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-infinitesimal-generator.md","status":"resolved","id":"327e84380a3593f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-infinitesimal-generator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"d139c8e88761c759","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P,K,p,m,L,D_L,L^*,D_{L^*}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TransitionDensity}_S(p,K,m;E,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InfinitesimalGenerator}_S(L,D_L,P,E,\\tau_E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(h,E,\\mathcal E,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FormalAdjoint}_{m,S}(L^*,D_{L^*};L,D_L;E,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"p_t(\\,\\cdot\\,,y)","display":false},{"tex":"p_t(x,\\,\\cdot\\,)","display":false},{"tex":"p(t,x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"C^1(\\mathbb R_{>0},\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formal\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}for\\text{-}kolmogorov}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FormalAdjoint}_{m,S}(L^*,D_{L^*};L,D_L;E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall u\\in D_L\\;\\forall v\\in D_{L^*}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(L(u)\\cdot v,E,\\mathcal E,m)\n\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(u\\cdot L^*(v),E,\\mathcal E,m)\\\\\n&\\hspace{14em}\\land\n\\int_E L(u)(z)v(z)\\,m(dz)=\\int_E u(z)L^*(v)(z)\\,m(dz)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}feller}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S(X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{TransitionDensity}_S(p,K,m;E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{InfinitesimalGenerator}_S(L,D_L,P,E,\\tau_E)\n\\land\\operatorname{FormalAdjoint}_{m,S}(L^*,D_{L^*};L,D_L;E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\\forall g\\in C_0(E,\\tau_E)\\;\n\\left(P(t)(g)(x)=\\int_E g(y)p(t,x,y)\\,m(dy)\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in E\\;\\Bigl(\np_t(\\,\\cdot\\,,y)\\in D_L\n\\land p_t(x,\\,\\cdot\\,)\\in D_{L^*}\n\\land p(\\,\\cdot\\,,x,y)\\in C^1(\\mathbb R_{>0},\\mathbb R)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in E\\;\\left[\n\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}p(t,x,y)\n=\\bigl(L[p_t(\\,\\cdot\\,,y)]\\bigr)(x)\n\\land\n\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}p(t,x,y)\n=\\bigl(L^*[p_t(x,\\,\\cdot\\,)]\\bigr)(y)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":3295,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3972","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-prop-kolmogorov-feller.md|58-prop-kolmogorov-feller]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["1212025633f2b50c","ef103f0303462b75","327e84380a3593f4","d139c8e88761c759"]}